 "brief": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "Proceed With Caution is 10 days old. The job now is keeping the tracks that are working alive and deciding what the next focus is. The artist sits at 848k monthly listeners and 337k Spotify followers.",
   "Of the singles, I Kinda Like That is the one working: 4.0M plays in 81 days, about 50k a day on average, Spotify popularity 66. The newest single, That\u2019s Not Fair, is at 363k plays after 38 days, roughly 10k a day, which is 19% of I Kinda Like That's pace. That is a soft lead-in to the release and worth naming out loud rather than hoping it turns.",
   "Of the brand-new tracks, Living Hell is the one listeners are picking: about 19k plays a day, popularity 56 after 10 days. That already outpaces Good For Me, That\u2019s Not Fair from the single campaign. The rest: Stoner Mentality (8k/day), It\u2019s Over (7k/day).",
